hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"37","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai, kehne lagay: Jo shakhs Jum'a ki raat Surah Al-Kahf parhe, uske aur Bait-e-Atiq ke darmiyan nur roshan kar diya jayega."
"38","[AI-translation] Aur farmaya Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam: Jo shakhs Surah Al-Kahf ko jaisi nazil hui hai parhe, woh qayamat ke din uske maqam se Makkah tak uske liye nur banegi, aur jo iski aakhri das ayaat parhe phir agar Dajjal nikal aaye toh us par tasallut nahi karega, aur jo wuzu kare phir kahe: Subhanaka Allahumma wa bihamdika, la ilaha illa anta, astaghfiruka wa atubu ilaik, toh ise barg par likh diya jayega phir muhr laga di jayega aur qayamat tak woh nahi tootegi."
"39","[AI-translation] Allah ka sab se azeem naam jise dua ki jaaye toh wo ijabat farmata hai, Quran ki teen suraton mein hai: Al-Baqarah, Aal-e-Imran, aur Ta-Ha mein."
